/self_assessment_check3.py --self-test` exit 0; v2's file byte-unchanged (`git -C /home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/revenger-shokunin diff --stat -- corpus/self_assessment_check2.py` empty). Report: the file path, the counter tail, and any case you could not satisfy.\n\nLane bounds: leaf member — no subagent dispatch except your single labrat.\nJudged on: calibration\nMilestone: Round 91: C1 calibration (SM6 v3 reads the stated cell; frozen battery 21 cases, 11 rule mutants; v2 red 5/22) and C2 operability capability (commit-message↔tree conformance instrument, absent -> CAP_MESSAGE_TREE=pass), 12-seat build+attack wave.\n\nReport: write your scoped findings to .ufo/waves/round-91/w1/ExecR91Sm6V3.md"
